    "I_sample22": {
        "body": "## Direct streaming from away\n\nPlay your library on a phone or laptop outside your home network, straight from your server. Lar opens a port on the router automatically (UPnP or NAT-PMP) and checks the connection from outside; there is no relay in between.\n\n- [x] Direct connection negotiation and authentication\n- [x] Device pairing codes\n- [ ] Reconnect with backoff when the address changes\n- [ ] Bandwidth probe before streaming\n- [ ] Clear guidance when the router can't open a port\n",
        "format": "markdown",
        "author": "maddec01",
