    },
    "79839d93-d1a7-59f1-b5c0-0973f550f344": {
        "record": {
            "bodyKind": "brief",
            "body": "## Goal\n\nA device with no saved server signs in with a Acme account first, then lists and joins the workspace's servers.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- The sign-in sheet opens once and returns to the app.\n- Each workspace shows its servers; picking one connects to it.\n- Apple TV shows a code instead.\n\n## Blockers\n\n- Look up a workspace's current servers in the registry when every saved address fails (ios#139)\n",
            "context": "",
            "buildPhase": null,
            "reviewRounds": []
        },
